```
$ swarfr status --help
List cargo target dirs under the roots: real size, families, what the passes could win

Usage: swarfr status [OPTIONS] [ROOT]...

Arguments:
  [ROOT]...  Dirs to search; a target dir itself works too [default: .]

Options:
      --json                Print the inventory as JSON
      --all                 List every build dir, not only the largest of each checkout and ecosystem
      --cargo-home [<DIR>]  Also measure the cargo home's unpacked sources, which costs another walk [default: $CARGO_HOME, else ~/.cargo]
  -h, --help                Print help

```
